  "details": "This is not an urgent bug; it's very situational and doesn't really affect anything -- it just looks weird!\n\nWhen invited to a group, and it's loading the group page, a string is incorrectly placed: \"All interactions are paused. Click to resume.\"\n\nI am assuming that this string comes from Avatar Interactions.\n\nRepro steps:\n\n1. Avatar interactions may have to be turned off\n\n2. Get invited to any group\n\n3. Join that group\n\n4. When loading the group page after joining, the text is displayed wrong",
